    "mainTitle": "DATA KNOWLEDGE BASE CURRENT STATUS AND OPERATION",
    "subTitle": null,
    "descriptions": [
      "<jats:p>The Data Knowledge Base (DKB) project aims at knowledge acquisition and metadata integration. Itprovides fast response for a variety of complicated queries, such as summary reports and monitoringtasks (aggregation queries) and multi-system join queries. Such queries are not easy to implement in atimely manner and, obviously, are less efficient than a query to a single system with integrated andpre-processed information would be. This work describes the status of the project as well as itsintegration with the ATLAS Workflow Management and future perspectives.</jats:p>"
